 "title": "The Horites of Seir",
 "ref": "Genesis 36:20–30",
 "col": "ochre",
 "intro": [
  "The Horites were the earlier inhabitants of Seir, whom the descendants of Esau dispossessed (Deuteronomy 2:12). The two families intermarried: Timna, Lotan's sister, bore Amalek to Eliphaz, and Oholibamah daughter of Anah became Esau's wife."
 ],
